# Navigation for Visual Explore

## Accessing Visual Explore

StereoMap's Visual Explore module can be accessed from the start page.

<figure><img src="../img/assets/home page-VE.png" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

## Load the Dataset

Open StereoMap and click Visual Explore to open your file system, and select `.stereo` file to load the dataset (see [Visual Explore Input Files](../getting-started.md#visual-explore-input-files) for more information).

<div><figure><img src="../img/assets/select dataset.png" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure> <figure><img src="../img/assets/select dataset-open.png" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>

